            // The approach:
            // Memory layout: [... | 0x00 | data[0] | data[1] | ... | data[n-1] | ...]
            //                        ^ data + 0x1f (the STOP prefix)
            // The initCode deployed via CREATE:
            //   CODESIZE returns the size of the initCode itself
            //   The trick: we prepend init code bytes before the data
