            // Wait CODECOPY pops 3 args: (destOffset=0, offset, size=n+1)
            // So we need 0 on top, then offset, then n+1
            // PUSH2(n+1) -> [n+1]
            // PUSH1(offset) -> [offset, n+1]  
            // RETURNDATASIZE -> [0, offset, n+1]
            // CODECOPY -> pops all 3, memory[0..n+1] = code[offset..offset+n+1], stack: []
